llling environment where these aseptic products were manufactlll·ed, which was subjected to repeated water incursion events into the aseptic manufactlll·ing areas and persistent recovery ofmold organisms."}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "The impact assessment did not thoroughly justify the conclusion that only some batches aseptically filled during this time pe1iod were impacted and subject to rejection or recall."}]}, "affected_work": {"status": "found", "value": "Excel Vision의 무균 의약품 제조 및 충전, 시판 제품의 불만·일탈 조사와 배치 영향 평가, 무균 구역·장비 관리 및 모니터링, 완제품 검사와 연간 제품 검토가 대상입니다.", "evidence": [{"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "TYPE ESTABUSI-N ENT INSPECTED Steri le Drug Manufac t urer"}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "There have been approximately 174 complaints since October 2024 repo1ting visual contamination including mold, black specks, and discoloration."}]}, "recommendation": {"status": "found", "value": "FDA는 관찰사항에 이의가 있거나 시정조치를 시행했거나 시행할 계획이면 실사 중 FDA 담당자와 논의하거나 해당 정보를 기재된 FDA 주소로 제출할 수 있다고 안내합니다. 이 Form 483은 최종 기관 판단이 아니며, 별도의 답변 제출 의무나 시정조치 기한은 발췌문에 명시되지 않았습니다.", "evidence": [{"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "If you have an objection regarding an observation, or have in1plemented, or plan to implement, corrective action in response to an observation, you may discuss the objection or action with the FDA representative{s) during the inspection or subrit this infonnation to FDA at the address above."}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "They are inspectional observations , and do not represent a final Agency detemiination regarding your compliance."}]}, "effective_date": {"status": "not_stated", "value": "", "evidence": []}, "response_deadline": {"status": "not_stated", "value": "", "evidence": []}, "reviewed_at": "2026-10-19", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "source_url": "https://www.fda.gov/media/192522/download", "scope": "확보한 본문 기준 · 첨부 및 미확보 페이지는 제외 · 자동 추출"}, "content_scope": "case", "scope_reason": "실무 관련성 검토 필요", "topics": ["sterility", "validation", "data-integrity", "deviation-ca